<section class="view show"><section class="card"><div class="cardHead"><div><b>Transfer payout PIN</b><br><span><%= data.source.reference %></span></div><span class="tag">Posted manual collection</span></div><div class="cardBody"><div class="summary"><div class="sumRow"><span>Generated PIN</span><b class="mono"><%= data.pin %></b></div><div class="sumRow"><span>Sender phone for payout</span><b><%= data.source.sender.phone %></b></div><div class="sumRow"><span>Receiver</span><b><%= data.source.beneficiary.name %></b></div><div class="sumRow"><span>Amount</span><b><%= typeof formatMoneyMinor==='function'?formatMoneyMinor(data.source.amountMinor,data.source.currency):data.source.amountMinor+' '+data.source.currency %></b></div></div><p class="tiny">This PIN is displayed once. The receiver needs the PIN and sender phone for payout. Share it privately if receiver SMS is unavailable. Cash is released only after receiver verification and independent payout approval.</p><a class="btn" href="/tenant/funded/<%= data.execution._id %>">Back to movement</a></div></section></section>
